{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪飾り大きすぎてお団子が見えない件"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽は何を良く聞くのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近アニソンにはまってる。\nシュガシュガルーンの曲かわいい！\n君に届け、荒川UB、となりの怪物くん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリソングもすきです。\nAMOYAMOさんも聴いてる♪\nかわいい曲"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れが溜まっているときは\nいつもどうしてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人でいる。寝る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたくて辛いよ(＊´・ω・＊)\n握手会行くにも遠くて...\nどうしたらいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか会いに行くよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の春服のこだわりとかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなようにいろんなの着ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いスカートは履かないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短パンとか履くよー。\n今度載せます！\nかわいくて短いの今度買おっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は全国握手会！\nミニライブと握手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっちの伊藤落ちろずじゃないよ。\n第14レーンきてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてチャリティイベント。\nたくさんの方に\n元気を与えられますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼さゆりんっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな顔してるけど、\nほんとは喜んでるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/19/9887115/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}